   "post_number": 1,
   "username": "JessicaZartler",
   "name": null,
   "created_at": "2020-11-27T00:34:55Z",
   "updated_at": "2020-11-27T00:34:55Z",
   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 2,
   "cooked": "<p>Jeff had a convo with Shermin, our Commons Stack advisor who is working on authoring a TE Economy book. We were discussing submitting a proposal for funding to buy a bunch of books at a discount, to support the author, and then offer those books as giveaways for working groups/raffles for our community. We are chatting to her about this and could involve other authors who have self published books in our multidisciplinary fields, could be a really nice value exchange <img alt=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\"/></p>\n<p>Hope we can make this happen after our launch! Thoughts, expansions?</p>",
   "action": null,
   "source": {
    "source": "commoncrawl",
    "timestamp": "20240616081208",
    "url": "https://forum.tecommons.org/t/book-airdrops-buying-supporting-te-books-for-community-giveaways/103/3"
   }
  },
  {
   "post_number": 2,
   "username": "Solsista",
   "name": null,
   "created_at": "2020-11-27T12:34:52Z",
   "updated_at": "2020-11-27T12:34:52Z",
   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 1,
   "cooked": "<p>Yes! What we call “sponsored burn” in the token model of A Hitchhiker’s Guide to Token Engineering - you can also have sponsored editions <a href=\"https://gitcoin.co/grants/798/a-hitchhikers-guide-to-token-engineering\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://gitcoin.co/grants/798/a-hitchhikers-guide-to-token-engineering</a></p>\n<p>If the book has a token model, this coordination game can take places without much ado <img alt=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\"/> But you could just use Giveth to raise buy a bunch of already available Token Economy books and send them - and support the TEC Proposal that comes from the <span class=\"hashtag\">#te-book</span> club!!! <img alt=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\"/> which will make this possible for digital books, transmission vehicles of knowledge <img alt=\":smiling_face_with_three_hearts:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/smiling_face_with_three_hearts.png?v=9\" title=\":smiling_face_with_three_hearts:\"/></p>",
   "action": null,
   "source": {
    "source": "commoncrawl",
    "timestamp": "20240616081208",
    "url": "https://forum.tecommons.org/t/book-airdrops-buying-supporting-te-books-for-community-giveaways/103/3"
   }
  },
  {
   "post_number": 3,
   "username": "Tannr",
   "name": null,
   "created_at": "2020-12-11T03:51:57Z",
   "updated_at": "2020-12-11T03:51:57Z",
   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 1,
   "cooked": "<p>Is this still something of interest for everyone? I can see this fitting in well with the scope of Pictosis as defined in <a class=\"inline-onebox\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/project-funding-proposal-pictosis-nfts-for-the-common-good/146/2\">Project Funding Proposal: Pictosis - NFTs for the Common Good</a></p>\n<p>Thoughts?</p>",
   "action": null,
   "source": {
    "source": "commoncrawl",
    "timestamp": "20240616081208",
    "url": "https://forum.tecommons.org/t/book-airdrops-buying-supporting-te-books-for-community-giveaways/103/3"
   }
  },
  {
   "post_number": 4,
   "username": "liviade",
   "name": null,
   "created_at": "2020-12-11T19:37:34Z",
   "updated_at": "2020-12-11T19:37:34Z",
   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 1,
   "cooked": "<p>I love the idea of having an internal library - we could expand the book clubs <img alt=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\"/></p>",
   "action": null,
   "source": {
    "source": "commoncrawl",
    "timestamp": "20240616081208",
    "url": "https://forum.tecommons.org/t/book-airdrops-buying-supporting-te-books-for-community-giveaways/103/3"
   }
  },
  {
   "post_number": 5,
   "username": "Solsista",
   "name": null,
   "created_at": "2020-12-21T16:01:29Z",
   "updated_at": "2020-12-21T16:01:29Z",
   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 2,
   "cooked": "<p>Had a great interview with Lisa - her idea on NFTs for distribution rights is super interesting, too! E.g. we could have a  TEC distribution; not just giveaway, but actually get discounts on such legendary textbooks like hers. Here’s an annotated link to interview: <a href=\"https://ahitchhikers.substack.com/p/christmas-special-chat-with-lisa\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://ahitchhikers.substack.com/p/christmas-special-chat-with-lisa</a></p>",
   "action": null,
   "source": {
    "source": "commoncrawl",
    "timestamp": "20240616081208",
    "url": "https://forum.tecommons.org/t/book-airdrops-buying-supporting-te-books-for-community-giveaways/103/3"
   }
  },
  {
   "post_number": 6,
   "username": "JessicaZartler",
   "name": null,
   "created_at": "2020-12-23T00:56:45Z",
   "updated_at": "2020-12-23T00:56:45Z",
   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 1,
   "cooked": "<p>Awesome! Can’t wait to hear about it! Catch me up on our next call <img alt=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\"/></p>",
   "action": null,
